  "description": "This varied circular walk visits several of the walking highlights near the Sussex village of Alfriston. The route first takes you south along the lovely Cuckmere River to Seven Sisters Country Park where you can enjoy a wonderful coastal path along the Seven Sisters Cliffs.  The route then leaves the coast heading through the expansive Friston Forest where there are miles of peaceful woodland trails and lots of wildlife to see. The trail then visits a significant local landmark at the Long Man of Wilmington before returning to Alfriston.",
